<title>USA: U.S. Sept S&amp;P 500s widen losses more than 20 pts.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sept S&amp;P 500s widen losses more than 20 pts.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 23 - U.S. Sept S&amp;P 500s futures widened losses more than 20 points in late trade. Talk that Japan would sell U.S. Treasuries pushed U.S. bond futures lower at the close and dragged down S&amp;Ps. Sept S&amp;Ps fell to 881.00 after hitting heavy sell-stop orders. Support is at 880.00.</p>
